# CST816 controller tests

Exercises the register transcript, the identification handshake, the single
point the controller decodes from the nibble-paired coordinate registers, the
finger-count poll that skips the coordinate read while the panel is bare, span
clamping, auto-sleep, and the lifecycle, against a recording MCU platform that
answers as the controller does. No hardware is involved.
